#### Modification Idea
Add a `palette` parameter to the function arguments (default value set to "Reds" to maintain default palette compatibility), and include the `palette = palette` parameter in both the `tm_dots` (point data) and `tm_fill` (polygon data) functions to enable custom color palettes.
